cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
title: >-
  Mammography + Chest X-ray Risk Subtyping: Multimodal Foundation-Model
  Fusion for Clinical Risk Factor Detection
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-03"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bentdixon/hiti-datathon-2026-cxr-mammo"
abstract: >-
  Assesses whether combining mammography and chest X-ray foundation-model
  embeddings improves detection of prevalent clinical risk factors (type 2
  diabetes, hypertension, hyperlipidaemia, chronic kidney disease) over
  either modality alone, via a penalised-logistic-regression arm and three
  nonlinear fusion architectures, reported per outcome and per subgroup.
  Developed for the HITI Lab's 2026 Datathon.
